:: RobinTemple Journal Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'robin-temple-journal'>>
  <<if $RobinTemple?.stage and $RobinTemple.stage isnot 'none'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <h1 class='header gold bold'>Robin and the temple</h1>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <h1 class='header gold bold'>罗宾与神殿</h1>
    <</language>>
    <ul class='journal'>
    <<switch $RobinTemple.stage>>
      <<case 'invited'>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin has questions about joining the temple. Talk in Robin’s room after making your own vow.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾对加入神殿还有疑问。立下自己的誓言后，去罗宾的房间谈谈。
        <</language>></li>
      <<case 'scheduled'>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Jordan will assess Robin on day <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.exam_day>></span>. Before then, find Robin at the orphanage from 17:00 to 19:15 and go to the temple together.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            约旦将在第 <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.exam_day>></span> 天为罗宾主持纯洁试炼。在此之前，17:00 至 19:15 可以去孤儿院找罗宾，一起到神殿准备。
        <</language>></li>
      <<case 'failed'>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin needs time to decide freely. Ask again in Robin’s room after day <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.exam_day + 7>></span>.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾需要时间自己考虑。第 <span class='gold'><<= $RobinTemple.exam_day + 7>></span> 天后再去房间询问。
        <</language>></li>
      <<case 'member'>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin has a place in the temple quarters. You can work together during the evening shift.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾在神殿宿舍有自己的位置。晚间值班时可以一起做事。
        <</language>></li>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            On school-free weekdays, you can invite Robin from <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> room to help at the temple from 09:00 until just before 15:45. You can also go together from 17:00 until just before 19:45. Robin helps with the Sunday service.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            不上学的工作日，09:00 起至 15:45 前，可以到罗宾房间约<<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>去神殿帮忙。17:00 起至 19:45 前也可以同行。罗宾会协助周日弥撒。
        <</language>></li>
        <<if !(maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus') and maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus').realEstate.residenceOf('Robin'))>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin stays overnight at the temple on Saturday.' '罗宾星期六夜里会留宿神殿。'>></li>
        <</if>>
        <<if $RobinTemple.punish>>
          <li><<lanSwitch 'The purification is unfinished. Continue it at the temple.' '净化尚未结束，返回神殿继续。'>></li>
        <<elseif $robinromance is 1 and $RobinTemple.service gte 3>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Ask Robin about making a promise during an evening shift. Jordan will weigh both your contributions, your shared work and Robin’s faith.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              晚间值班时可以和罗宾谈承诺仪式。约旦会分别考虑你们的神殿贡献、共同完成的工作，以及罗宾对誓言的信仰。
          <</language>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Shared temple shifts: <span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.service>></span>/3
            <<option 'CN'>>
              已一起完成的神殿值班：<span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.service>></span>/3
          <</language>></li>
        <</if>>
      <<case 'approved'>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Jordan approved the rite. Meet Robin in the temple quarters in the evening.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            约旦批准了仪式。傍晚去神殿宿舍见罗宾。
        <</language>></li>
      <<case 'promised'>>
        <<if $RobinTemple.dual_promise>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              You brought Robin and Sydney into the ruin beneath the lake, and made your promises there. The temple knows only the first, and will summon all three of you for the next examination.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              你带着罗宾与悉尼进了湖底废墟，在那里立下承诺。神殿只知道第一份，下次检查会将你们三人一并召去。
          <</language>></li>
        <<else>>
          <li><<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Your promise to Robin is recognised by the temple. Jordan will examine your vows together.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              神殿见证了你和罗宾的承诺。约旦会一同检查你们的誓言。
          <</language>></li>
        <</if>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Days until the next examination: <span class='gold'><<= Math.max(0, maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').publicPromise is 'Sydney' ? $temple_chastity_timer : $RobinTemple.chastity_timer)>></span>
          <<option 'CN'>>
            距离下次检查还有：<span class='gold'><<= Math.max(0, maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').publicPromise is 'Sydney' ? $temple_chastity_timer : $RobinTemple.chastity_timer)>></span>
        <</language>></li>
    <</switch>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member>>
      <li><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin's trial of anguish: <<if $RobinTemple.vigil_result is 'passed'>>passed; Robin is now a <<if C.npc.Robin.pronoun is 'm'>>monk<<else>>nun<</if>> and has a bunk in the quarters.<<else>>not yet passed; Robin remains an initiate and has not been assigned a bunk.<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾的苦难审判：<<if $RobinTemple.vigil_result is 'passed'>>已通过，现为<<if C.npc.Robin.pronoun is 'm'>>修士<<else>>修女<</if>>，已分到宿舍床铺。<<else>>尚未通过，仍是见习教徒，尚未分到床铺。<</if>>
      <</language>></li>
    <</if>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.faith_transition isnot ''>>
      <li><<lanSwitch 'Robin has something to say about the temple. Listen next time you pray together.' '罗宾有些关于神殿的想法想告诉你。下次一起祈祷时可以听听。'>></li>
    <</if>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.hospital_stage isnot ''>>
      <li><<lanSwitch 'Your hospital visit with Robin is unfinished. You can continue it at the hospital entrance.' '罗宾陪同的这次就诊尚未结束。可以在医院门口继续。'>></li>
    <</if>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member>>
      <li><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<= maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith lt 0 ? "Robin’s doubt" : "Robin’s faith" >>: <span class='teal'><<= Math.abs(maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith)>></span>/100
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾的<<= maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith lt 0 ? '动摇' : '信仰' >>：<span class='teal'><<= Math.abs(maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith)>></span>/100
      <</language>></li>
    <</if>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member>>
      <li><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin's temple contribution: <span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.grace>></span>/100.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾的神殿贡献：<span class='teal'><<= $RobinTemple.grace>></span>/100。
      <</language>></li>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Robin')>>
        <li><<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Temple duties add <span class='gold'>£<<= $RobinTemple.grace * 10>></span> to Robin's weekly income. This is included in <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> business and rent accounts.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            神殿事务为罗宾带来每周 <span class='gold'>£<<= $RobinTemple.grace * 10>></span> 的津贴，计入<<nnpc_his 'Robin'>>的经营收入与房租结算。
        <</language>></li>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
    <<if $temple_spear_mission is 1 and !$RobinTemple.spear_seen>>
      <li><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin has heard about Jordan’s spear mission. Speak to Robin at the temple bench before setting out.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾听说了约旦交代的取矛任务。出发前，可以在神殿长椅与罗宾谈谈。
      <</language>></li>
    <<elseif $temple_spear_mission gte 2 and $RobinTemple.spear_seen and !$RobinTemple.spear_return_seen>>
      <li><<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You promised to tell Robin how the spear journey went. Find <<nnpc_him 'Robin'>> at the temple bench.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你答应把取矛的经过告诉罗宾。去神殿长椅找<<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>。
      <</language>></li>
    <</if>>
    </ul>
    <hr>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>
